{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01554",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.7,
      "end_seconds": 3.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.34,
      "end_seconds": 8.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.96,
      "end_seconds": 12.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "It's loose stools with blood, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.08,
      "end_seconds": 17.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.28,
      "end_seconds": 21.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "I've had it for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.14,
      "end_seconds": 27.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.2,
      "end_seconds": 34.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "It happens a couple of times a week. Severe, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.28,
      "end_seconds": 39.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "What about mouth ulcers, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.31,
      "end_seconds": 46.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, about two weeks. With mouth ulcers, moderate, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.3,
      "end_seconds": 52.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "So, have you noticed fever, vomiting or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.37,
      "end_seconds": 56.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.16,
      "end_seconds": 59.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Yes. What about joint pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.01,
      "end_seconds": 63.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Nope, no joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.23,
      "end_seconds": 68.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.0,
      "end_seconds": 74.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "no, that's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.45,
      "end_seconds": 77.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.8,
      "end_seconds": 78.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.99,
      "end_seconds": 83.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.59,
      "end_seconds": 87.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.17,
      "end_seconds": 90.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Right, any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.88,
      "end_seconds": 95.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Just part of my thyroid removed, years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.74,
      "end_seconds": 102.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "So, are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.11,
      "end_seconds": 109.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Trimethoprim. I come out in... well, a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.47,
      "end_seconds": 113.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.84,
      "end_seconds": 117.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.3,
      "end_seconds": 131.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Alright, do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.39,
      "end_seconds": 135.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.07,
      "end_seconds": 140.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.65,
      "end_seconds": 146.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.72,
      "end_seconds": 149.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.52,
      "end_seconds": 154.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.13,
      "end_seconds": 158.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.84,
      "end_seconds": 163.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "My father has Parkinson's disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.21,
      "end_seconds": 173.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.76,
      "end_seconds": 182.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.29,
      "end_seconds": 209.47,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.9, BP is 114 over 77, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, respiratory rate 18, heart rate 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.75,
      "end_seconds": 216.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.25,
      "end_seconds": 219.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.2,
      "end_seconds": 234.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "There is tenderness in the lower right tummy and no guarding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.32,
      "end_seconds": 240.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.51,
      "end_seconds": 263.35,
      "duration_seconds": 14.84,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? I'd lean towards a flare of inflammatory bowel disease. I'd like to arrange a stool test for bloody diarrhoea. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.37,
      "end_seconds": 265.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.72,
      "end_seconds": 292.35,
      "duration_seconds": 25.63,
      "text": "What I'm giving you is prednisolone, 40 milligrams, once a day, one week then reduce. It's for inflammatory bowel flare. Keep up your fluids and call the IBD nurse if you get a fever. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I'd like to see you again in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.12,
      "end_seconds": 295.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "alright, I'll be back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.39,
      "end_seconds": 302.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.16,
      "end_seconds": 307.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Uh, no, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.29,
      "end_seconds": 310.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "So, goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}